rows.en:
"Gyah!"
Hino let out a short groan.
Then his eyes rolled back until only the whites showed.{p}

This is one guy I'll never forgive.
I don't care what happens to me!
I clenched my fist and swung at him.{p}

"You bastard... how dare you."
Hino's bloodshot eyes turned on me.
"How dare a piece of prey like you do that to me. That settles it. Your sentence is death, right now!"{p}
